        "severity": "major",
        "category": "toolchain",
        "source_dimension": "build_env",
        "harmony_status": "partial",
        "remediation": "使用 CMake -DC_LAPACK=1 将 LAPACK 编译为 C 源码，或 -DBUILD_WITHOUT_LAPACK=1 仅构建 BLAS/CBLAS，避免依赖 gfortran。",
        "evidence": [
          "CMakeLists.txt:34",
          "cmake/system.cmake:439-451",
          "Makefile.system:1210"
        ]
      },
      {
        "issue": "非 x86 架构的动态 CPU 型号探测依赖 /proc/cpuinfo 或 sysctl，鸿蒙内核未必提供等价接口",
        "severity": "major",
        "category": "sysfs_procfs",
        "source_dimension": "native_api",
        "harmony_status": "partial",
        "remediation": "x86_64 仍可使用 cpuid 指令；arm64 下若 /proc/cpuinfo 不可用，需改用 OHOS 系统能力读取 CPU 特性，或关闭 DYNAMIC_ARCH、在编译时固定 TARGET。",
        "evidence": [
          "cpuid_arm64.c:165",
          "driver/others/dynamic_arm64.c:378"
