      {
        "issue": "可选 OpenMP 运行时需鸿蒙侧提供兼容版本，否则构建失败",
        "severity": "minor",
        "category": "native_dependency",
        "source_dimension": "dependencies",
        "harmony_status": "partial",
        "remediation": "默认使用 pthreads 后端，不启用 USE_OPENMP；如需 OpenMP，需确保 libomp/libgomp 已移植并可用。",
        "evidence": [
